Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Yasaka+Shrine+Kyoto,+Kyoto,+Japan</description><styleUrl>#day12</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>135.77839,35.00349,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Kōdai-ji</name><description>Templo y jardines con iluminación nocturna especial.
Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Kodai+ji+Kyoto,+Kyoto,+Japan</description><styleUrl>#day12</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>135.78135,35.00032,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>13 diciembre · templos y Arashiyama</name><Placemark><name>Kinkaku-ji</name><description>Pabellón Dorado y estanque.
