Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Ryoanji+Kyoto,+Kyoto,+Japan</description><styleUrl>#day13</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>135.71806,35.03349,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Tō-ji</name><description>Pagoda de cinco plantas e iluminación nocturna final del 13 de diciembre.
