Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Tenryuji+Kyoto,+Kyoto,+Japan</description><styleUrl>#day13</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>135.67462,35.01617,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Bosque de bambú de Arashiyama</name><description>Sendero entre altos bambús.
