Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Okochi+Sanso+Kyoto,+Kyoto,+Japan</description><styleUrl>#day13</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>135.66967,35.01666,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Puente Togetsukyō</name><description>Puente histórico y paseo junto al río Katsura.
Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Togetsukyo+Bridge+Kyoto,+Kyoto,+Japan</description><styleUrl>#day13</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>135.6775,35.0097,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>14 diciembre · Yamashina Gishi y eventos</name><Placemark><name>Bishamondō · salida del desfile</name><description>Punto de salida del Yamashina Gishi Matsuri a las 10:00.
