Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Nanzenji+Kyoto,+Kyoto,+Japan</description><styleUrl>#alt_templos</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>135.7951,35.0117,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Sanjūsangen-dō</name><description>Templo conocido por sus 1.001 figuras de Kannon.
Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Sanjusangendo+Kyoto,+Kyoto,+Japan</description><styleUrl>#alt_templos</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>135.7718,34.9879,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Heian-jingū</name><description>Santuario con gran torii y arquitectura de inspiración imperial.
